#: Modals/enableexternallapack.md:2
msgid "--enable-external-lapack option"
msgstr "--enable-external-lapack オプション"

#: Modals/enableexternallapack.md:25
msgid ""
"You can also only disable the external LAPACK. In other words, you can use "
"the internal version of LAPACK with an external version of BLAS by using the"
" command:"
msgstr ""
"External LAPACK だけを無効にし、Internal LAPACK と External BLAS を組み合わせることもできます。"
